{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs"],"title":"Preparing your project","anchor":"Preparing-your-project"}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose YubiKit’s log level and backend with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs\/configure(logLevel:factory:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/LoggingGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No setup is required. YubiKit defaults to "},{"code":"debug","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on stdout when compiled with "},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"code":"info","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on stderr otherwise. You can override either default:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import YubiKit","import Logging","","\/\/ Show warnings and errors.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .warning)","","\/\/ Use your preferred backend.","YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .debug) { label in","    StreamLogHandler.standardOutput(label: label)","}","","\/\/ Turn logging off.","YubiKit.Logs.configure { _ in SwiftLogNoOpLogHandler() }","","\/\/ Restore defaults.","YubiKit.Logs.configure()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Logging"},{"type":"text","text":" product to your app target"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to use its backend types. Any SwiftLog "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LogHandler"},{"type":"text","text":" can be supplied by the factory."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass its factory explicitly; global "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap"},{"type":"text","text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Traffic-logging","text":"Traffic logging"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit to be compiled with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Warning","style":"warning"},{"anchor":"Custom-backends","type":"heading","text":"Custom backends","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Labels identify categories, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key=value"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Logging","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"documentation-header.png":{"alt":"YubiKeys in a row","type":"image","identifier":"documentation-header.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header@2x.png","traits":["2x","light"]},{"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header~dark@2x.png","traits":["2x","dark"]}]},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/Logs/configure(logLevel:factory:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configure","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"logLevel","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Logging6LoggerV","text":"Logger","kind":"t